H1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3483500503","user":"C**","time":"10月3日","star":5,"text":"新启汇新开的，感觉菜品没很多。点了个「猪排饭」，猪排稍微有点咸，但是又鲜又多汁。荷包蛋也脆脆的，口味总体还不错。\n\n但是我点了之后店员说很久没看到，问了我才发现下单了，搞得我等了好久，不过店员态度还可以。建议堂食的客人下单后问一句","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Gmd7aLPvcUD6jlzVXCiPVqMO3CMjQ30aHWcDVRmj_vszzPWjOJwoMAvsiAC20tILElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3479026362","user":"睿**","time":"10月1日","star":5,"text":"这次点的是肥牛饭，本来以为就是普通白米饭打底，结果端上来才发现竟然是炒饭，不是常见的白米饭，这一点还挺让人惊喜的，上面还加了一颗荷包蛋。摆盘也挺用心，肥牛、炒饭和荷包蛋搭配得整整齐齐，颜色好看，端上桌就很有食欲。价格方面，餐点每份大概在 40~60 左右。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Q822wg-cIX0IMdCHGdVmQ_fCT8s0A8qt__zGzTzVrVN6k0y9cwqN858hCYm_w_mTElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3475833518","user":"爆**","time":"9月30日","star":5,"text":"凯瑞餐厅番茄意面猪扒套餐推荐！金黄猪扒外脆里嫩，搭配酸甜番茄意面，口感很搭。分量足，出餐快，店内干净。单人简餐性价比不错，想吃意面配肉可以点这套。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/aufoqeqmC1NsJkPm0rvNcdbIPNGe1a3fSlLatMNVbIePGSPIuflfiGtuJPOOn-QfElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/5NV9xSWfL75ToKdS6qSuSDjJ04c21w_s7958FfLAgi5fdXyEWUi1ET5t8Ap_qt5dElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3473279984","user":"匿**","time":"9月29日","star":5,"text":"新开的一家店，位于张江板块中科路13号线3号口的新启汇商场一层，星巴克的边上，被麦当劳和霸王茶姬围绕。小小的门面，主打西式简餐，出餐速度快，特别满意他们家的猪扒饭，上面有香香的罗勒叶，配菜有西蓝花红椒，猪扒煎的焦嫩适中，米饭上淋着很有特色的蜜汁酱，口味很独特，本次品尝了他家的意面，喜欢。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/79NsdFoGG-dBE268o9alm1zlIk9ORD0_-s07Q1Ixw7Q9j_yUV0zPAwIq-BIlXthhElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/pOJ3B8nUrPotTWjZqA6Rv-RjSpDpWn7lp9hN_akhTHbM4GPerVhGmjl3PF7HmfAfElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/D74TSbEbGTsVPk_emk0FyHH71-niJUaJ2t6Ykqc8pRYCDZV-CwC8_fgKSAJjVe-nElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/AmvQ5CrRpg-IWyGtvyIhPxVNTMezucZRxp2gzuFfR4DA-HKsPRS61aUK5o8Xnxf-Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3472364427","